# CR 613.8a between two static abilities: Kaito, Bane of Nightmares enters after Ygra, so his "during your turn ... he's a
# Ninja creature" has the later timestamp, but Ygra's "Other creatures are Food artifacts" depends on it (it changes what
# Ygra's effect applies to) and applies after it. On Bot1's turn Kaito is a Ninja creature that is also a Food artifact.
# On Bot2's turn he is a planeswalker, no creature, so Ygra's effect does not apply to him at all.

